exports[`envelopes persisted by Plate 49 R01-cost-table-merged exports to markdown 1`] = `
"**<span style="font-size: 32px;">What does all of this cost?</span>**

| **Personal**                  | **Commercial**                | **Enterprise**             |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------- |
| Free \\[Offline & Self Hosted] | Free \\[Offline & Self Hosted] | Contact Us                 |
